			"notes": "## New\n- **Minecraft 1.21.11, 26.1–26.1.2, 26.2 and 26.3 support**, alongside 1.21.6–1.21.8.\n\n## Also\n- The project now builds every Minecraft version from one source tree with Stonecutter, on Mojang mappings.\n\nPick the jar whose name ends with your Minecraft version. Requires Fabric API, MaLiLib and Litematica for the same version."
